WEBVTT

00:00:03.020 --> 00:00:05.450
You're all finally here!

00:00:05.450 --> 00:00:07.050
Long time no see!

00:00:07.050 --> 00:00:08.790
We're here again!

00:00:08.790 --> 00:00:11.090
After winning the district tournament,

00:00:11.090 --> 00:00:13.360
we head for the city tournament.

00:00:13.360 --> 00:00:16.100
Amarillo, who won the national tournament last year,

00:00:16.100 --> 00:00:19.770
as well as the Heavens, who hold a grudge against us, are both waiting.

00:00:20.370 --> 00:00:22.570
There are plenty of other strong teams,

00:00:22.570 --> 00:00:26.140
but the Predators won't lose until
 they become number one in the galaxy!

00:00:26.140 --> 00:00:27.840
Okay! Let's go!

00:00:28.310 --> 00:00:29.980
Yeah!

00:02:30.460 --> 00:02:31.630
Kageura-kun!

00:02:32.100 --> 00:02:36.240
He's probably coming here as the captain to call upon having a fair game.

00:02:40.570 --> 00:02:42.210
Eh? He ignored me?

00:02:44.980 --> 00:02:46.510
Outa Shou-kun?

00:02:47.180 --> 00:02:49.780
I remember everyone I meet.

00:02:49.780 --> 00:02:51.220
Excuse me.

00:02:51.220 --> 00:02:52.650
This has nothing to do with you.

00:02:52.650 --> 00:02:55.620
R-Really?

00:02:57.420 --> 00:02:59.190
Furuyas.

00:02:59.190 --> 00:03:00.730
Huh? What do you want?

00:03:01.630 --> 00:03:05.760
I want to fight you this year with everything I've got.

00:03:05.760 --> 00:03:07.570
You guys better win so we can play.

00:03:08.870 --> 00:03:13.010
Must be nice not having any strong team in your block.

00:03:13.010 --> 00:03:14.710
Yeah.

00:03:14.710 --> 00:03:18.980
We can't advance into the finals without defeating the Heavens.

00:03:18.980 --> 00:03:24.350
I'm quite jealous of Amarillo's dumb luck.

00:03:24.950 --> 00:03:27.190
That cannot be helped.

00:03:27.190 --> 00:03:30.760
Well, with the three of you being in the team, there should be no problem.

00:03:30.760 --> 00:03:33.260
Otherwise there'll be no point in beating you.

00:03:36.160 --> 00:03:38.500
I'll be waiting for you in the finals.

00:03:46.470 --> 00:03:48.040
Later.

00:04:24.380 --> 00:04:27.710
Looks like Yabusawa Eleven are going to win.

00:04:28.510 --> 00:04:31.420
We're facing this team in the second round, right?

00:04:31.420 --> 00:04:33.220
Yes.

00:04:33.220 --> 00:04:34.690
Aren't they strong?

00:04:35.420 --> 00:04:38.620
They use 4-4-2, an orthodox formation,

00:04:38.620 --> 00:04:42.190
but their attacks from the sides are very sharp.

00:04:42.190 --> 00:04:43.630
They're a great team.

00:04:43.630 --> 00:04:46.870
What's the point in getting nervous over such a team?

00:04:46.870 --> 00:04:49.800
I feel that they're pretty strong.

00:04:49.800 --> 00:04:52.170
Have you forgotten?

00:04:52.170 --> 00:04:54.840
We played against this team in a practice match last year.

00:04:54.840 --> 00:04:58.510
I think we barely won 2-1,

00:04:58.510 --> 00:05:01.850
and looks like over half of their team from back then is still here.

00:05:01.850 --> 00:05:04.950
We only have the Furuyas.

00:05:06.350 --> 00:05:08.450
It's no big deal.

00:05:12.290 --> 00:05:14.760
We're changing the formation for the next match.

00:05:15.890 --> 00:05:18.560
Coach, why?

00:05:18.560 --> 00:05:23.270
I think our formation during the 
district matches were pretty good.

00:05:23.270 --> 00:05:27.210
We have to seal off their attacks from the sides.

00:05:27.210 --> 00:05:28.910
We'll be having four in the back.

00:05:28.910 --> 00:05:32.850
Ouzou will move backwards a bit towards the defense line.

00:05:32.850 --> 00:05:36.180
Kota and Ryuuji will switch places.

00:05:36.180 --> 00:05:37.320
What?

00:05:37.320 --> 00:05:41.520
We'll use our strong points to their fullest.

00:05:43.420 --> 00:05:46.990
Ryuuji will use his skills to break up the opponent's rhythm.

00:05:48.960 --> 00:05:51.900
What do you mean?

00:05:51.900 --> 00:05:53.900
He's aiming for an own goal.

00:05:53.900 --> 00:05:55.630
Own goal?

00:05:55.630 --> 00:05:58.570
I've noticed it before,

00:05:58.570 --> 00:06:01.610
but does Ryuuji-kun really do that?

00:06:02.570 --> 00:06:04.040
Well, I guess.

00:06:04.040 --> 00:06:06.850
How do you do it, then?

00:06:06.850 --> 00:06:08.610
Well...

00:06:11.020 --> 00:06:12.520
I can't tell you.

00:06:12.520 --> 00:06:14.850
It's a business secret.

00:06:14.850 --> 00:06:17.720
In any case, let's aim to win in the first half.

00:06:17.720 --> 00:06:20.260
You guys can play however you like in the second half.

00:06:22.090 --> 00:06:24.400
Then I can be a forward?

00:06:25.130 --> 00:06:26.830
Yeah.

00:06:26.830 --> 00:06:30.340
You guys are strong. Don't lose in spirit.

00:06:30.340 --> 00:06:32.570
You know what the word "Predator" means, right?

00:06:32.570 --> 00:06:36.540
I think it means a carnivore in English.

00:06:36.540 --> 00:06:37.010
Yes.

00:06:37.280 --> 00:06:38.380
Yes.

00:06:38.380 --> 00:06:40.850
If you're a carnivore, then hunt for your prey.

00:06:40.850 --> 00:06:44.520
The pitch is your field with plenty of prey.

00:06:45.980 --> 00:06:48.420
Steal the ball and that's a hit.

00:06:48.420 --> 00:06:51.120
Shoot and that's another hit.

00:06:51.120 --> 00:06:54.260
Count the number of hits you get inside your own heads!

00:06:54.260 --> 00:06:56.660
Sounds interesting.

00:06:56.660 --> 00:06:58.530
Let's go hunting, everyone.

00:06:58.530 --> 00:07:00.970
Sounds good.

00:07:00.970 --> 00:07:05.570
If stealing the ball counts, then even the defenders can be in!

00:07:05.570 --> 00:07:07.610
Can I do this?

00:07:07.610 --> 00:07:08.540
Of course you can!

00:07:09.140 --> 00:07:14.580
Does feinting and dribbling past someone count as a hit, too?

00:07:14.580 --> 00:07:16.010
Yep.

00:07:16.010 --> 00:07:18.020
Yes! If that's the case...

00:07:25.790 --> 00:07:27.090
Yes!

00:07:30.830 --> 00:07:33.570
Our match starts at 2 PM.

00:07:33.570 --> 00:07:37.700
Have your lunches a bit early and we'll start practicing at 1 PM.

00:07:37.700 --> 00:07:39.600
Before that you guys are free to do whatever.

00:07:39.600 --> 00:07:40.510
Yes!

00:07:41.110 --> 00:07:43.480
What are you gonna do, Shou-kun?

00:07:43.480 --> 00:07:46.810
I'm gonna go check out the next match.

00:07:46.810 --> 00:07:51.520
Kiyose Kickers, who put up a good match against Amarillo last year, are playing.

00:07:51.520 --> 00:07:54.990
The winner of that match will play the Heavens, right?

00:07:54.990 --> 00:07:56.960
How about you, Reika-chan?

00:07:56.960 --> 00:08:00.260
I want to practice kicking the ball.

00:08:00.260 --> 00:08:01.990
All right.

00:08:01.990 --> 00:08:05.200
I'll leave the scouting to you, Captain.

00:08:05.200 --> 00:08:07.170
Okay.

00:08:13.440 --> 00:08:14.610
Shou-kun!

00:08:14.610 --> 00:08:17.510
How were the Kiyose Kickers?

00:08:17.510 --> 00:08:20.310
They're quite strong!

00:08:20.310 --> 00:08:25.680
It ended 2-0, but their defense is like an iron wall!

00:08:25.680 --> 00:08:28.520
I don't care about the other teams.

00:08:28.520 --> 00:08:30.760
We need to focus on our own match.

00:08:30.760 --> 00:08:33.430
Oh? Kota-kun, you're getting fired up.

00:08:33.430 --> 00:08:35.590
Stop joking around with him.

00:08:35.590 --> 00:08:37.700
If we want to face Aoto and the Heavens,

00:08:37.700 --> 00:08:40.170
then we must win the next match.

00:08:50.880 --> 00:08:52.240
Aoto...

00:08:57.350 --> 00:08:58.320
Tch.

00:09:02.790 --> 00:09:06.430
Okay! Start with the pre-match warmups!

00:09:06.430 --> 00:09:07.230
Yes!

00:09:08.930 --> 00:09:12.300
Kota told us to focus on the match at hand,

00:09:12.300 --> 00:09:16.940
but he kept staring at Aoto-kun during practice.

00:09:17.900 --> 00:09:20.240
Jeez.

00:09:24.210 --> 00:09:27.750
The important notions you need to know for hunting are challenging and covering.

00:09:28.350 --> 00:09:29.820
Be aware of those!

00:09:29.820 --> 00:09:31.620
Yes!

00:09:31.620 --> 00:09:34.790
Um... Challenging and covering?

00:09:34.790 --> 00:09:36.460
Hey, hey.

00:09:36.460 --> 00:09:38.860
You forget things too easily, Shou-kun.

00:09:38.860 --> 00:09:40.760
Eh? Everyone knows?

00:09:41.990 --> 00:09:47.970
Yabusawa Eleven allows both their sidebacks to overlap with the offense in their attack.

00:09:47.970 --> 00:09:54.070
Our defenders, Saionji-san and Ukishima-kun, will have to steal the ball effectively.

00:09:54.070 --> 00:09:55.640
That's called "Challenge."

00:09:55.640 --> 00:09:59.180
Shou-kun and Ouzou-kun will read their passing lanes.

00:09:59.180 --> 00:10:04.180
In case our two defenders get overrun, Shou-kun and Ouzou-kun are to "cover" them.

00:10:04.180 --> 00:10:05.750
I see!

00:10:05.750 --> 00:10:08.590
What if their forwards run down the middle?

00:10:08.590 --> 00:10:11.960
Shou-kun and Ouzou-kun will challenge them,

00:10:11.960 --> 00:10:15.660
while Saionji-san and Ukishima-kun will do the covering.

00:10:15.660 --> 00:10:16.600
Yup.

00:10:16.600 --> 00:10:18.130
Well, Takatou is there, too.

00:10:18.130 --> 00:10:20.270
I've got your back. Don't worry.

00:10:20.270 --> 00:10:23.400
Just focus on covering Saionji.

00:10:23.400 --> 00:10:24.300
Roger that!

00:10:24.900 --> 00:10:27.310
Then let's win!

00:10:27.310 --> 00:10:28.710
Okay!

00:10:30.180 --> 00:10:34.110
Coach! We'll win fair and square!

00:10:35.380 --> 00:10:36.410
Okay!

00:10:38.250 --> 00:10:39.720
We are...

00:10:39.720 --> 00:10:41.790
...the Momoyama Predators!

00:10:41.790 --> 00:10:43.360
Our goal is...

00:10:43.360 --> 00:10:44.990
...becoming number one in the galaxy!

00:10:44.990 --> 00:10:47.960
We'll win, win, and win!

00:10:48.590 --> 00:10:50.200
Yeah!

00:11:02.240 --> 00:11:05.310
Oh? Everyone looks pumped up.

00:11:05.310 --> 00:11:07.550
Coach Hanashima, I'll be counting on you as always.

00:11:27.370 --> 00:11:29.170
Reika-chan, challenge him!

00:11:36.780 --> 00:11:38.710
Challenge!

00:11:50.260 --> 00:11:52.660
Shou-kun, nice covering!

00:11:54.030 --> 00:11:55.860
Reika-chan, don't mind!

00:11:56.390 --> 00:11:58.000
Nothing to worry about!

00:11:58.000 --> 00:12:00.830
Just put up a more aggressive challenge!

00:12:00.830 --> 00:12:01.830
Okay!

00:12:16.880 --> 00:12:20.320
More aggressive... Aggressive... Aggressive!

00:12:31.830 --> 00:12:35.430
I can do it, too!

00:12:48.250 --> 00:12:50.720
First one!

00:12:52.620 --> 00:12:53.890
Yoi!

00:12:53.890 --> 00:12:55.720
Jeez, I was about to get my second prey!

00:13:09.170 --> 00:13:10.270
One!

00:13:21.050 --> 00:13:22.750
Yes!

00:13:23.320 --> 00:13:25.420
One here, too.

00:13:32.060 --> 00:13:32.920
I see.

00:13:33.630 --> 00:13:37.900
Masaru-chan-san has accepted the own-goal technique, it seems.

00:13:37.900 --> 00:13:41.130
"I think that's one of our strong points," he said.

00:13:41.130 --> 00:13:43.770
Yes, quite interesting.

00:13:43.770 --> 00:13:47.910
He's a coach that accepts my sons for who they are.

00:13:51.340 --> 00:13:54.380
I should join in on the hunt, too.

00:14:05.120 --> 00:14:06.620
He fell for it!

00:14:06.620 --> 00:14:09.560
Nice challenge! Big Tri!

00:14:28.510 --> 00:14:29.980
That's the only place!

00:14:44.100 --> 00:14:45.700
The second one!

00:14:45.700 --> 00:14:48.170
Yes!

00:14:48.170 --> 00:14:50.200
Another own goal?

00:14:50.200 --> 00:14:51.870
Goals are goals.

00:14:51.870 --> 00:14:53.510
What are you doing!?

00:14:53.510 --> 00:14:56.210
You're letting the triplets run wild!

00:14:56.210 --> 00:14:57.980
Mark them tightly!

00:15:20.030 --> 00:15:23.070
Now it's my turn to challenge.

00:15:23.070 --> 00:15:24.470
Focus!

00:15:31.410 --> 00:15:32.610
That's my prey!

00:15:32.610 --> 00:15:36.080
You slowed down their offense, I'll give you that.

00:15:36.080 --> 00:15:37.720
Tch.

00:15:39.320 --> 00:15:41.490
Everyone's getting man-marked.

00:15:41.490 --> 00:15:44.660
Now's the time to try <i>that</i>.

00:15:44.660 --> 00:15:45.960
Small Tri!

00:15:46.660 --> 00:15:48.430
It's Reverse Three, jeez!

00:15:58.070 --> 00:15:59.400
Let's go!

00:16:19.060 --> 00:16:20.990
Yes!

00:16:20.990 --> 00:16:23.830
The 3U scored all by themselves.

00:16:23.830 --> 00:16:29.130
Well, that's due to us drawing away the defense.

00:16:29.130 --> 00:16:33.000
That's great! Our attacking options just increased!

00:16:33.000 --> 00:16:35.370
Good decision, Captain.

00:16:36.810 --> 00:16:39.780
Yes! Good job!

00:16:39.780 --> 00:16:46.990
Two own goals... You could have scored normally, right?

00:16:46.990 --> 00:16:48.120
Are you mad?

00:16:48.120 --> 00:16:52.560
No, it's just that I don't find own goals interesting.

00:16:52.560 --> 00:16:56.630
I think scoring on your own is more interesting.

00:16:56.630 --> 00:17:01.370
Then I think I'll just shoot a blooter like
 what Kota-kun would do for my third goal.

00:17:02.770 --> 00:17:05.500
Rin-chan, what's the matter?

00:17:05.500 --> 00:17:07.840
I think I've gotten enough film here.

00:17:07.840 --> 00:17:11.640
I'm heading over to the Heavens' game.

00:17:11.640 --> 00:17:12.840
Take care.

00:17:19.180 --> 00:17:20.290
Yoi!

00:17:41.540 --> 00:17:43.710
Still an own goal, I see.

00:17:43.710 --> 00:17:47.510
That wasn't planned. It was an accident.

00:17:47.510 --> 00:17:49.580
Oh well.

00:17:56.150 --> 00:17:58.520
How did you guys do in your hunt?

00:17:58.520 --> 00:18:02.890
I got five! How about you, Reika-chan?

00:18:02.890 --> 00:18:04.530
I only got one.

00:18:04.530 --> 00:18:06.830
That's great!

00:18:06.830 --> 00:18:08.600
I got four.

00:18:08.600 --> 00:18:09.470
Me, too.

00:18:09.470 --> 00:18:12.170
I'm the goalkeeper, so I pass on this game.

00:18:12.170 --> 00:18:14.940
Rather, I didn't even touch the ball once.

00:18:17.080 --> 00:18:19.910
They didn't even shoot once at us.

00:18:19.910 --> 00:18:21.410
I got three.

00:18:21.410 --> 00:18:23.010
Me, too.

00:18:23.010 --> 00:18:24.480
I got five.

00:18:24.480 --> 00:18:26.150
How about you, Kota-kun?

00:18:26.150 --> 00:18:27.350
Only one.

00:18:27.350 --> 00:18:29.620
Tch, how nice.

00:18:30.220 --> 00:18:34.430
I was busy covering and giving orders, so I got zero.

00:18:34.430 --> 00:18:38.130
I got one chance, but Erika-chan stole it.

00:18:38.130 --> 00:18:41.600
Yes, yes, I'm sorry about that.

00:18:42.300 --> 00:18:45.970
Then my eight times in the first half puts me on top.

00:18:45.970 --> 00:18:50.240
I'll be the forward during the
 second half. I'll catch up to you real quick.

00:18:50.240 --> 00:18:52.980
Kota-kun, please keep that up!

00:18:54.050 --> 00:18:55.450
Leave that to me.

00:18:57.920 --> 00:19:00.420
This atmosphere is nice.

00:19:00.420 --> 00:19:01.250
Eh?

00:19:01.250 --> 00:19:04.860
It's like we're all one! I feel so excited!

00:19:04.860 --> 00:19:07.590
Everyone's like that thanks to you.

00:19:07.590 --> 00:19:09.030
Eh?

00:19:09.030 --> 00:19:13.330
Please keep on giving us correct
 orders during the second half, <i>Captain</i>.

00:19:14.500 --> 00:19:16.230
Everyone!

00:19:18.170 --> 00:19:21.610
Okay! Let's keep it up the second half!

00:19:21.610 --> 00:19:22.970
Yeah!

00:19:23.810 --> 00:19:28.880
Kota-kun scored two goals the second half, just like he planned.

00:19:28.880 --> 00:19:30.720
Erika-chan scored, too.

00:19:30.720 --> 00:19:33.820
We got a huge lead heading into extra time.

00:19:41.760 --> 00:19:43.830
Ryuuji, lend me your ear.

00:19:45.000 --> 00:19:46.530
Roger that.

00:19:47.300 --> 00:19:50.230
I'll defend here.

00:19:50.230 --> 00:19:53.600
Shou-kun, go to the far side and grab the header.

00:19:53.600 --> 00:19:54.740
Okay.

00:20:07.120 --> 00:20:08.790
Score, Captain.

00:20:16.560 --> 00:20:18.160
Oh, it's here!

00:20:20.600 --> 00:20:23.070
Eh? What a nice ball!

00:20:23.070 --> 00:20:24.670
Head it in, Shou!

00:20:26.240 --> 00:20:28.870
That's a present just for you!

00:20:28.870 --> 00:20:31.380
I see! Just for me!

00:20:31.780 --> 00:20:33.510
Okay!

00:20:34.310 --> 00:20:37.250
Don't close your eyes! Always keep them on the ball!

00:20:37.250 --> 00:20:38.550
Okay!

00:20:38.550 --> 00:20:39.580
Next one!

00:20:40.690 --> 00:20:43.550
The center of your forehead! Not your right!

00:20:46.590 --> 00:20:48.030
Next one!

00:20:49.060 --> 00:20:52.760
Watch closely with your eyes and use the center point of your forehead!

00:20:55.200 --> 00:20:59.540
If you don't look at where you are heading, then it's all pointless.

00:21:00.000 --> 00:21:01.370
Yes!

00:21:03.570 --> 00:21:05.310
Watch the ball until the very end!

00:21:10.720 --> 00:21:13.680
As if I can give up!{I can't give up!}

00:21:30.330 --> 00:21:32.800
I-I did it...

00:21:34.240 --> 00:21:36.670
I did it.

00:21:37.480 --> 00:21:39.840
I did it!!

00:21:39.840 --> 00:21:44.980
I scored my first goal in an official match!

00:21:44.980 --> 00:21:46.750
Good job, Shou-kun!

00:21:46.750 --> 00:21:49.250
Thanks! It's thanks to everyone!{Thanks, everyone!}

00:21:49.250 --> 00:21:53.720
Hurray! Hurray!

00:22:00.060 --> 00:22:02.200
Coach, what are you doing?

00:22:02.200 --> 00:22:03.940
We won.

00:22:04.500 --> 00:22:06.340
Oh, sorry.

00:22:06.340 --> 00:22:09.910
I'm just concerned about the match on pitch #2.

00:22:13.310 --> 00:22:16.910
How will we play during the finals?

00:22:16.910 --> 00:22:19.180
Think about that first yourselves.

00:22:19.180 --> 00:22:22.350
The finals will be against Amarillo,

00:22:22.350 --> 00:22:25.020
but before that we have a decisive match.

00:22:25.020 --> 00:22:26.660
Huh?

00:22:26.660 --> 00:22:31.130
Heavens are so strong. Kiyose got beat 6-2.

00:22:31.130 --> 00:22:33.330
6-2!?

00:22:33.330 --> 00:22:38.500
They only lost to Amarillo last year 2-1!

00:22:38.500 --> 00:22:41.470
It was quite interesting.

00:22:41.470 --> 00:22:45.210
Number 10 scored all the goals himself!

00:22:45.210 --> 00:22:46.510
He's a genius!

00:22:47.250 --> 00:22:49.510
Aoto, huh?

00:22:53.120 --> 00:22:54.720
Aoto...

00:24:35.390 --> 00:24:38.090
We're finally playing against the Heavens!

00:24:38.090 --> 00:24:40.060
Aoto-kun is there.

00:24:40.060 --> 00:24:41.790
This won't go as smoothly as our previous matches.

00:24:41.790 --> 00:24:44.330
The triplets, the coach, and Kyoko-san are all going gaga!

00:24:44.330 --> 00:24:46.600
Aoto-kun really is really amazing.

00:24:46.600 --> 00:24:48.270
The coach wants us to go with a low guard.

00:24:48.270 --> 00:24:50.770
